       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose.** The usual range is 50\u2013200 mg per day, and 200 mg/day is the labeled maximum. A dose of 1000 mg is in overdose territory, with risk of serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation and seizures.\n\nThe order may have an extra zero, and **100 mg** or **10 mg** was intended. Can you confirm which dose you meant?\n\n- **Sertraline 100 mg PO once daily**, a common maintenance dose\n- **Sertraline 50 mg PO once daily**, the usual starting dose for depression and most anxiety disorders\n- Another dose: please give the amount\n\nAs soon as you confirm, I'll enter the order."
